2,1,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Takumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I believe we need to understand the human cost of these plans. I will look into the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to see if the complaints match the reality. I'll check the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates. It is always prudent to see where the money actually resides before we dream.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,I will look into the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme. It is wise to remember what we have already tried.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I will examine the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes. I suspect the obstacles to our progress are often hidden in the fine print.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, do you think the money is actually there, or are you just expecting more budget arguments?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A bit of both, I suspect. I prefer to enter these discussions armed with the actual figures rather than the optimistic summaries we are usually provided.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a noble pursuit, Benjamin. Clarity in the present is only possible when we acknowledge the patterns of the past.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Servas. Understanding the hidden frictions in our processes is just as vital as knowing the budget.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm just worried we'll pick a plan that looks good on paper but doesn't actually save anyone any time.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"That is a valid concern, Takumi. Logic suggests that efficiency is not merely the absence of complaints, but the optimization of the actual passenger experience.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,Indeed. We must ensure we are not simply treating the symptoms of a problem while the underlying cause remains untouched.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,Which is why I am curious if the delays we see are due to the physical environment or the administrative hurdles between our partners.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I think we have covered the necessary ground for this round. I am satisfied with my choices and will wait for the findings.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Me too. Let's see if the data actually backs up the complaints or if we're just chasing ghosts.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. I look forward to seeing if the ledger reflects our ambitions or merely our delusions.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Servas,,I believe we have a comprehensive approach. Let us proceed with a spirit of openness and a willingness to learn from the evidence.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Let us see what the records reveal and how they might guide our final decision.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
